            <ArticleTitle>Late development of an aneurysm of a saphenous vein used as an aortocoronary conduit.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1294-5, A10</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A case of a large saphenous vein aortocoronary aneurysm that developed late after coronary artery bypass grafting is presented. This is the first case of a large saphenous vein aortocoronary aneurysm identified by serial angiography and 3-dimensional computed tomographic scanning.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
